{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1766643,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Barter Mania- \" The Ultimate Barter Challenge\"","festival_id":null,"organization_id":12593,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-06T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-14T15:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/barter-mania-the-ultimate-barter-challenge-atma-ram-sanatan-dharma-college-arsd-du-new-delhi-1766643","region":"hybrid","details":"<p><strong><u>BARTER MANIA&nbsp;<\/u><\/strong><br \/><br \/><strong>Presented by Commercico,<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong> The Commerce Association of Atma Ram Sanatan Dharma College<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>Think you know commerce? Time to put it to the test.<\/strong><br \/><br \/>Commerce isn't just about knowing the numbers. It's about understanding markets, spotting opportunities, making decisions under pressure, and knowing when to <strong>trade, negotiate or hold your ground.<\/strong><br \/><br \/><strong>BARTER MANIA<\/strong> is a two-round competition designed to take you from the basics of commerce to the heart of real-world decision-making.<br \/>From a fast-paced online quiz testing your <strong>commerce, finance, general awareness and aptitude<\/strong> to an immersive <strong>offline trade and barter challenge<\/strong>, every round will test a different side of your commercial thinking.<br \/>Because in the real world:&nbsp;<br \/><strong>Resources are limited. Needs aren't. And the best deal isn't always the obvious one.<\/strong><br \/>Think fast. Trade smart. Negotiate better.<br \/><strong>Are you ready to make the right deal?<\/strong><br \/>&nbsp;<br \/><strong><u>Stages &amp; Timelines<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>Round 1: The Commerce Sprint- Online Quiz<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><br \/>The first round is your entry into the world of BARTER MANIA.<br \/>A <strong>10-minute online quiz comprising 15 questions<\/strong> will test your basic understanding of:<br \/><strong>Commerce &amp; business<\/strong><br \/><strong>Finance<\/strong><br \/><strong>Economics<\/strong><br \/><strong>Quantitative aptitude<\/strong><br \/><strong>Logical reasoning<\/strong><br \/><strong>General awarenes<\/strong><br \/>Don't expect an impossible finance exam. The questions are designed to test <strong>basic conceptual understanding, awareness and quick thinking.<\/strong><br \/>&nbsp;<br \/><strong>Format:<\/strong> Online<br \/><strong>Platform:<\/strong> Unstop<br \/><strong>Questions:<\/strong> 15<br \/><strong>Duration:<\/strong> 10 minutes<br \/><strong>Nature:<\/strong> Eliminatory<br \/>The highest-performing participants\/teams will qualify for the offline round.<\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>Round 2: The Trading Floor- Offline Finale<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>This is where commerce leaves the screen.<\/strong><br \/>Shortlisted participants will be invited to <strong>Atma Ram Sanatan Dharma College<\/strong> for a live, on-campus commerce simulation.<br \/>You will enter a market where <strong>resources are scarce, requirements are different and every decision has a price.<\/strong><br \/>Teams will be given different resources and financial positions.<br \/>You'll have to <strong>buy, sell, barter, negotiate and strategise<\/strong> to secure the resources you need and maximise your position.<br \/>The team that understands the market, negotiates the smartest deals and makes the right decisions under pressure will emerge victorious.<\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>Mode:<\/strong> Offline<br \/><strong>Venue:<\/strong> Atma Ram Sanatan Dharma College<br \/><strong>Format:<\/strong> Live Trade &amp; Barter Simulation<br \/><strong>Final winners:<\/strong> Determined on the basis of performance in the offline round.<\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>Who Can Participate?<\/strong><br \/>Open to <strong>college students<\/strong><br \/>Students from <strong>all academic backgrounds<\/strong> are welcome<br \/>Cross-college participation can be allowed<br \/><strong>Team size:<\/strong> 2-3<br \/>A participant can be part of only one team.<br \/>&nbsp;<br \/><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Round 1 will be conducted online through the Unstop platform.<br \/>Round 1 will consist of <strong>15 questions to be attempted in 10 minutes<\/strong>.<br \/>Round 1 will be eliminatory.<br \/>Shortlisted participants\/teams will be informed about the offline round through their registered contact details.<br \/>The offline round will be conducted <strong>at Atma Ram Sanatan Dharma College, New Delhi<\/strong>.<br \/>Participants qualifying for Round 2 must be physically present at the venue at the stipulated time.<br \/>Detailed rules and mechanics of the trade\/barter simulation will be communicated before the commencement of Round 2.<br \/>Any form of malpractice will result in immediate disqualification.<br \/>The decision of the organising committee shall be <strong>final and binding<\/strong> in all matters.<br \/>The organisers reserve the right to modify the format, timelines or structure of the competition, if required.<\/p>\n<p>Further details regarding the offline round will be shared through the official LinkedIn page of the Commerce Association, ARSD College. Participants are requested to follow the page and stay updated.&nbsp;<br \/><a title=\"LinkedIn\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/commercico-the-commerce-association-of-arsdc\/\">https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/commercico-the-commerce-association-of-arsdc\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Exciting Cash and Kind prizes worth \u20b910000.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":1318747,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-06T13:31:35+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-06T16:15:54+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_au